WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Wanwan

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:04,000
I heard that you and Xiao Lin went out for dinner yesterday, right?

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
You young people should have more fun and talk about your dad.

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,280
I really don't like her

5
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:09,640
When he sees her, he goes against the grain

6
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:11,520
Today I mainly invite friends to dinner

7
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,000
Boyfriend or girlfriend?

8
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,090
What kind of ordinary boyfriend?

9
00:00:17,370 --> 00:00:18,610
There seem to be a lot of police in her house

10
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:19,850
My sisters are also police officers

11
00:00:20,090 --> 00:00:25,210
I am also starting a company. What do you think about being motivated? What does a company do?

12
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:28,580
It seems to be energy

13
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:31,820
She doesn't know this is what our family does.

14
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:33,700
It's the one who saved me from Jinding Mountain

15
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,020
I listened to her call

16
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:37,020
Their company also cooperates with Academician Lin

17
00:00:39,110 --> 00:00:40,870
Energy and Academician Lin
